-The method is implemented in various isosurfacing libraries, such as `IsoMesher`, where it is selected via preprocessor symbols (e.g., `BISECTION`). [S2] It is also used in differentiable volumetric rendering pipelines, where it is called as an alternative to the Secant method for refining ray-surface intersections. [S1]
